","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1341102008:1":{"key":"say:10:1341102008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1341102008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"没错。很古老，但早已覆灭了，现在是名副其实的亡灵帝国。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1341102009:1":{"key":"say:11:1341102009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1341102009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"嗯，我的同伴大多数都是为了追猎班题斯的亡灵——那些试图...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1341102010:1":{"key":"say:12:1341102010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1341102010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但我的主要目标是找到那些污染了我家乡的亡灵们。他们用邪...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1341102011:1":{"key":"say:14:1341102011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1341102011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"亡灵、污染、侵袭……听起来很像薄暮丛林发生的事情！难道...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_